IDENTIFICATION DIVISION. PROGRAM-ID. T. DATA DIVISION. WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256). 01 A PIC X VALUE 'A'. 01 N PIC 99 VALUE 12. PROCEDURE DIVISION. DISPLAY A N.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING A DELIMITED SIZE N DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
