        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF. CALL 'S1' BY CONTENT A BY REFERENCE N. DISPLAY A N.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING A DELIMITED SIZE N DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "B99"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [B99] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF. STOP RUN. IDENTIFICATION DIVISION. PROGRAM-ID. S1. DATA DIVISION. LINKAGE SECTION. 01 P PIC X. 01 Q PIC 99. PROCEDURE DIVISION USING P Q. MOVE 'B' TO P. MOVE 99 TO Q. DISPLAY P Q.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING P DELIMITED SIZE Q DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "A99"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [A99] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF. EXIT PROGRAM. END PROGRAM S1.

